BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:How Women Artists Can Create Financial Abundance: Panel Discussion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260929T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260929T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1633351@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerNCWCA (Northern California Wom
 en’s Caucus for Art)\, in partnership with Commonwealth Club World Affai
 rs\, will present “Creating Financial Abundance\,” a panel discussion 
 for women in the arts\, on Tuesday\, September 29 in San Francisco. The pr
 ogram runs 5 to 8 p.m. and focuses on fiscal management\, budgeting\, inve
 stment strategies\, and resources to help women artists build toward finan
 cial security and wealth. An interactive audience session follows the pane
 l\, then a networking reception with refreshments sponsored by Schwab Corp
 oration.\nThe panelists bring substantial experience in starting businesse
 s\, running an art practice as a business\, and building wealth:\n\nSheila
  Cunningham is an executive and business coach. Her focus is teaching prac
 tical tools which give businesses a solid grasp of financials\, organizati
 onal management\, and sales processes to increase profitability for small 
 businesses. Sheila’s career has been spent studying successful and unsuc
 cessful businesses as a reporter and editor at BusinessWeek magazine\, as 
 well as spending ten years in entrepreneurial ventures. Sheila is Trustee 
 and Treasurer of the Mechanics’ Institute and a member of the Financial 
 Women of San Francisco.\n\nRegina Tsai is a Schwab Certified Financial Pla
 nner and Wealth Strategist who has been a senior wealth advisor since 2017
 . As a core member of a Schwab Wealth Advisory™ Team\, she provides peri
 odic investment recommendations and insights from the Schwab Cen...\n\n$54
 .00\n\nTickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-09-29/women-e
 mpowering-women-3-creating-financial-abundance\nDetails: https://sf.funche
 ap.com/women-artists-create-financial-abundance-panel-discussion/\nSource:
  Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WeW3.p
 ng
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club (SF) (110 The Embarcadero)\, 110 The Embarcader
 o\, San Francisco CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/women-artists-create-financial-abundance-panel
 -discussion/
END:VEVENT
