DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerThe UNDSCVRD Entrepreneur Summ
 it brings together a curated group of Filipino entrepreneurs\, founders\, 
 creatives\, and community leaders across industries for an evening of conn
 ection\, conversation\, and collective visioning.\nAs Kultivate Labs celeb
 rates 10 years of supporting entrepreneurs and building economic opportuni
 ty in SOMA Pilipinas Filipino Cultural Heritage District\, we’re enterin
 g a new chapter. In the years ahead\, our work will expand beyond the boun
 daries of the Filipino Cultural District to support entrepreneurs across S
 an Francisco and\, eventually\, beyond – while building on our roots in 
 the Filipino community and extending what we’ve learned to other Black\,
  Indigenous Entrepreneurs of Color.\n\nThe Summit is an opportunity for en
 trepreneurs to help inform where we go next. Following networking and a sh
 ort presentation on the state of small business\, economic development\, a
 nd our vision for the Filipino Cultural District\, attendees will take par
 t in facilitated conversations around three key areas:\nEksplora: AI + Ent
 repreneurship – Get an early introduction to Eksplora\, Kultivate Labs
 ’ new AI learning initiative\, and help us shape how it can best serve e
 ntrepreneurs. We’ll explore how you’re using AI today\, where the bigg
 est gaps and opportunities are\, and what kinds of tools\, training\, and 
 hands-on support would help you put AI to work in your business.\nKapwa Ga
 rdens 2.0 – Help us review emerging concepts for the next evolution of K
 ...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.undiscoveredsf.com/\nDetails: https://
 sf.funcheap.com/free-filipino-undscvrd-entrepreneur-summit-soma/\nSource: 
 Funcheap SF
