BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Save the “Sixth Street Homeless Self-Help Center” Rally (SF Ci
 ty Hall)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T104500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T120000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638278@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Community
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerHospitality House is holding a
  rally on the steps of San Francisco City Hall opposing the proposed closu
 re of the Sixth Street Self-Help Center. The center provides low-barrier p
 eer support\, case management\, behavioral health resources\, housing and 
 employment referrals\, therapy and support groups\, and basic-needs servic
 es for people experiencing homelessness\, poverty\, behavioral health chal
 lenges\, and isolation. Attendees are invited to bring signs and support t
 he effort to preserve the center.\nOriginal Event Description:\n_📣 SAVE
  OUR SIXTH STREET — RALLY AT CITY HALL\nOn Wednesday\, September 30\, 20
 26\, Hospitality House is taking our fight to the steps of San Francisco C
 ity Hall.\nFor years\, the Sixth Street Self-Help Center has been more tha
 n a building. It is a place where people experiencing homelessness\, pover
 ty\, behavioral health challenges\, and isolation can walk through the doo
 r and be met with dignity\, compassion\, and community.\nSixth Street prov
 ides low-barrier access to peer support\, case management\, behavioral hea
 lth resources\, housing and employment referrals\, therapy and support gro
 ups\, basic needs\, and—just as importantly—a place where people know 
 they belong.\nWe are asking our community to stand with us.\nJoin Hospital
 ity House staff\, community members\, neighborhood partners\, supporters\,
  and advocates on the steps of City Hall as we call attention to what the 
 closure of Sixth Street would mean for the people who rely on it.\nOur nei
 gh...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/DdejBbuTI0m/?utm_sou
 rce=ig_web_copy_link&amp\;stkn=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==\nDetails: https://sf.funch
 eap.com/save-sixth-street-homeless-selfhelp-center-rally-sf-city-hall/\nSo
 urce: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/815653
 613_18389774320162508_6511916187866674974_n.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:San Francisco City Hall Steps\, 1 Dr Carlton B Goodlett Pl\, San 
 Francisco\, CA 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/save-sixth-street-homeless-selfhelp-center-ral
 ly-sf-city-hall/
END:VEVENT
