DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerFree Admission Day at Yerba Bu
 ena Center for the Arts (YBCA)Opened to the public in 1993\, YBCA was foun
 ded as the cultural anchor of San Francisco’s Yerba Buena Gardens neighb
 orhood. Our work spans the realms of contemporary art\, performance\, film
 \, civic engagement\, and public life. Centering artists as essential to s
 ocial and cultural movement\, YBCA is reimagining the role an arts institu
 tion can play in the community it serves.\nYBCA is located in the heart of
  San Francisco’s SOMA neighborhood\, across the street from SFMOMA and t
 he Moscone Convention Center. The main entrance to our galleries and forum
  event space is at 701 Mission Street. The main entrance to our theater is
  700 Howard Street.\n\nYBCA is open Wednesday–Sunday\, 11–5pm.\nEntry 
 to YBCA Galleries is free every Wednesday\nTicketing\nGalleries\nMembers: 
 Free\nAdult (18+): $10\nStudents & Seniors: $5\nYouth (17 and under)\, Mil
 itary Personnel\, & Museums for All: Free\nWednesdays: Free\nEmployees of 
 other museums with current valid staff ID receive free general admission f
 or themselves and one guest.\nMuseums for All\nYBCA offers free admission 
 for Medi-Cal and EBT card holders as part of the Museums for All program. 
 Benefits card required upon entry. Tickets must be purchased at the ticket
 ing desk at YBCA.\nHours\nGalleries\nWed–Sun: 11 AM–5 PM\nMon–Tues: 
 Closed\n\nUpcoming Free Admission Day at Yerba Buena Center for the Arts (
 YBCA) Events\nWed 10/7 Free Admission Day at Yerba Buena Center for the Ar
 ts...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.ybca.org/visit-us\nDetails: https://
 sf.funcheap.com/free-admission-day-at-yerba-buena-center-for-the-arts-ybca
 -155/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ybca-b
 uilding.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Yerba Buena Center for the Arts\, 701 Mission Street San Francisc
 o\, CA 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-admission-day-at-yerba-buena-center-for-t
 he-arts-ybca-155/
END:VEVENT
