DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMeet 3–5 pre-screened startu
 ps and connect with founders\, investors\, and entrepreneurs at an evening
  focused on early-stage companies and new investment opportunities in San 
 Francisco.\nInvestor Connect: Pitch & Deal Flow Night features live 8-minu
 te startup presentations followed by Q&A. Founders share their teams\, tra
 ction\, business models\, and fundraising goals\, giving attendees an oppo
 rtunity to discover emerging companies and ask questions directly.\nAfter 
 the pitches\, attendees can continue conversations with founders and inves
