 lready know. What else is possible?\n\nOver six weeks\, we explore the mov
 ing body through feet\, hips\, spine\, arms\, breath\, and finally the who
 le body—each through the map of the 5Rhythms®.\nCome discover new ways 
 to move\, sense\, express\, release\, and connect.\nThursdays · 7:00–8:
 30 PM\nOctober 1\, 22 & 29 · November 5\, 12 & 19\nJoe Goode Annex · 401
  Alabama St · San Francisco\nPlease note: No classes October 8 & 15.\nDoo
 rs open at 6:50 PM.\nDoors close at 7:15 PM to support the continuity of t
 he practice.\nNo steps to learn. No dance experience needed.\nCome exactly
  as you are.\nDrop-ins welcome · Full 6-week series registration availabl
 e.\n\n$32.00\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta.com/events/162018/t/tickets\nD
 etails: https://sf.funcheap.com/moving-body-map/\nSource: Funcheap SF
