BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Parenting Workshop: Decode Your Child’s Behavior (Mill Vall
 ey)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T100000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638176@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Kids Families
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBehind the Behavior: Understan
 ding Your Child at Every Developmental Stage and What You Might See at Hom
 e\nFriday\, October 2\, 2026\n9:00-10:00 a.m. / Marin Horizon School Libra
 ry\nWhen we think about the beginning of the school year\, we think about 
 new teachers\, new friends\, new expectations\, and all of the logistics o
 f parenting a school-aged child. And then comes the push for more independ
 ence\, the nightly meltdown that didn’t happen last year\, or the “ple
 ase don’t talk to me in front of my friends.” We may find ourselves wo
 ndering what happened and how did we get here? It’s easy to feel lost wh
 en our children enter a new developmental stage. We may understand what to
  expect from a parenting book or article\, but it can be much harder to re
 cognize and respond to these changes when they show up at home. In this wo
 rkshop\, we’ll explore the developmental stages of the elementary and mi
 ddle school years\, what to expect as children grow and change\, and pract
 ical ways to navigate these new phases while strengthening communication\,
  connection\, and understanding with your child.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https
 ://www.marinhorizon.org/student-life/parent-education\nDetails: https://sf
 .funcheap.com/free-parenting-workshop-decode-childs-behavior-mill-valley/\
 nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screen
 shot-2026-09-22-at-12.15.26-PM.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Marin Horizon School\, 305 Montford Ave\, Mill Valley CA 94941
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-parenting-workshop-decode-childs-behavior
 -mill-valley/
END:VEVENT
