BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free 2026 Book Launch w/ Nat Geo Photographer Kiliii Yüyan (Corte
  Madera)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1636678@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lectures Workshops
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer Event Oct 2 with Nat Geo Phot
 ographer and Author Kiliii Yüyan at Books Passage Corte Madera\nOn Octobe
 r 2\, National Geographic photographer and explorer Kiliii Yüyan will be 
 giving a multimedia author presentation based his book Guardians of Life: 
 Indigenous Knowledge\, Indigenous Science\, and Restoring the Planet which
  launched April 2026 from Braided River\, the conservation imprint of Moun
 taineers Books.\n\nHere is the link to the event: https://bookpassage.com/
 event/kiliii-yuyan-guardians-life\n\nHere is a TEDX talk on the project\, 
 a TV spot on the book launch\, and the book’s Press Release.\nPlease see
  below for more details about Kiliii and the book:\n\nAbout the book:\nGua
 rdians of Life: Indigenous Knowledge\, Indigenous Science\, and Restoring 
 the Planet\nThere is a critical yet underrecognized role that Indigenous p
 eoples around the world have played—and continue to play—in sustaining
  biological and cultural diversity. As the biodiversity and climate crises
  converge\, the time to support Indigenous leadership is now. This rich\, 
 in-depth\, storytelling initiative is based on growing global recognition 
 of the critical role Indigenous peoples play in sustaining biological and 
 cultural diversity\, as well as adapting to and abating climate change.\n\
 nThis book\, Guardians of Life\, is based on the work of award-winning Nat
 ional Geographic photographer Kiliii Yüyan\, and will take readers on a t
 ransformative journey to places and people living in relationship wi...\n\
 nFree\n\nTickets: https://bookpassage.com/event/kiliii-yuyan-guardians-lif
 e\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-2026-book-launch-nat-geo-photogra
 pher-kiliii-yyan-corte-madera/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Kiliii
 -Yuyan-High-Res-Headshot-by-Yugu-Ningeok-1.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Book Passage Corte Madera\, 51 Tamal Vista Blvd. Corte Madera\, C
 A 94925
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-2026-book-launch-nat-geo-photographer-kil
 iii-yyan-corte-madera/
END:VEVENT
