 n• Glendford Lumbao\n• Jethro Patalinghug\n• Melanie Tiongson\nExhib
 ition Statement:\n\nFilipino sailors arrived in Morro Bay\, California in 
 October 1587\nAnd the rest is history\nSince then\, Filipinos have been le
 aving an imprint on American history that has enabled us to celebrate ever
 y October as Filipino American History Month\nThrough distinct Filipino fl
 air and ambition\, we’ve left a mark and Sentro Filipino is celebrating 
