 abletop Library are officially swinging open. On Saturday\, October 3 and 
 Sunday\, October 4\, we’re throwing a two-day celebration at 3048 Clarem
 ont Ave in Berkeley\, and you’re invited.\nWe’ll be open 9am to 11pm b
 oth days\, with complimentary tours and open play all day long. Wander the
  stacks\, pull something intriguing off the shelf\, and grab a table. Ever
 y hour there’s something happening\, whether you’ve been gaming for de
 cades or still aren’t sure what a meeple is.\n\nWhy Come By?\nThe Tablet
 op Library is a members-only board game social club with 24 tables\, a col
 lection of more than 1\,100 games\, a curated retail shop\, and a 500-viny
 l record collection. Opening weekend is your chance to see it all before d
 eciding whether to make it your new third place.\nThe Details\nWhen: Satur
 day\, October 3 and Sunday\, October 4\, 9am to 11pm\nWhere: 3048 Claremon
 t Ave\, Berkeley\, CA 94705\nWhat: Hourly learn-to-play sessions\, designe
 r talks\, complimentary tours\, and open play all day\nMore info: https://
 tabletoplibrary.com\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.tabletoplibrary.com/ne
 ws/grand-opening-weekend-october-3-4\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/tab
