BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:28th Annual Bay Area Anarchist Book Fair (Oakland)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T170000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1633762@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lectures Workshops
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerThe Bay 28th Annual Bay Area A
 narchist Book Fair brings together dozens of publishers\, micro-presses\, 
 and community organizations for a day of book and information tables\, wor
 kshops\, panel discussions and skill sharing\n\nThis year we ponder the An
 alog: In an age of mass collapse and rising technofascism\, how can we cre
 ate alternative technologies to further our goals? What strategies and tac
 tics are at our disposal to fight big tech? And how can we meaningfully di
 vest from mainstream technology?Bay Area Anarchist Book Fair is an annual 
 event that brings together people interested and engaged in radical work t
 o connect\, learn\, and discuss through books and information tables\, wor
 kshops\, panel discussions\, skill sharing\, and more!\n\nDozens of publis
 hers\, micro-presses\, and community organizations. We seek to create an i
 nclusive space to introduce new folks to anarchism\, foster a productive d
 ialogue between various political traditions as well as anarchists from di
 fferent milieus\, and create an opportunity to dissect our movements’ st
 rengths\, weaknesses\, strategies\, and tactics.\n\nThis year we ponder th
 e Analog: In an age of mass collapse and rising technofascism\, how can we
  create alternative technologies to further our goals? What strategies and
  tactics are at our disposal to fight big tech? And how can we meaningfull
 y divest from mainstream technology?\n\nThe event is free and wheelchair a
 ccessible. KN95 or N95 masks required indoors and encouraged...\n\nFree\n\
 nTickets: https://bayareabookfair.noblogs.org\nDetails: https://sf.funchea
 p.com/28th-annual-bay-area-anarchist-book-fair-oakland/\nSource: Funcheap 
 SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-B
 ay-Area-Anarchist-Book-fair-artwork.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:The Humanist Hall\, 390 27th Street\, Oakland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/28th-annual-bay-area-anarchist-book-fair-oakla
 nd/
END:VEVENT
