UID:funcheap-1634377@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Kids Families
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer\n\nThis is Your City. This is
  Your Voice. This is Your Future. Share your story about growing up and ra
 ising your family in San Francisco.\n\nEvery family has a story. Every voi
 ce matters. Please share yours.\n\nJoin us for the District 5 Fillmore Fam
 ily Summit! The This Is Your City: Family Summit Series invites families\,
  caregivers\, young people\, and community members from across San Francis
 co to help shape the future of our city.\n\nSaturday\, Oct. 3\, 2026\, 11:
 00 a.m. – 1:30 p.m.\nAfrican American Arts and Culture Complex (AAACC)\,
  762 Fulton St\, SF\, CA 94102\n\nFree food\, childcare\, and interpretati
 on are provided. Please note all interpretation requests must be made 48 h
 ours or more prior to the Family Summit.\nWho should attend? Everyone is w
 elcome. This event highlights District 5\, but you can attend any Family S
 ummit that fits your schedule.\nWhy are we gathering? The Family Summit Se
 ries is part of San Francisco’s first Citywide Community Needs Assessmen
 t. Through conversations with families across the city\, we’re learning 
 what matters most to children\, youth\, young adults\, and families. What 
 we learn will help improve future planning\, programs\, and services.\nWhe
 ther you’ve lived in San Francisco your whole life or recently made it y
 our home\, your experiences and ideas matter.\nDistrict 5 Neighborhoods in
 clude: Tenderloin\, Civic Center\, Hayes Valley\, Lower Haight\, Western A
 ddition\, Fillmore\, Alamo Square\, Japantown\, NoPA\, and Haight Ashbury\
 n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/district-5-fillmore-famil
 y-summit-tickets-1996544498340?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://sf.func
 heap.com/district-5-fillmore-family-summit/\nSource: Funcheap SF
