DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerYou’re invited to the first-
 ever Temescal Arts Community Art Week\, happening October 3–10!\nWe’re
  organizing a week of art\, built on a simple belief: creativity heals\, a
 nd creating together makes our community stronger\, more resilient\, and m
 ore whole.\n\nEvery day\, from October 3rd to the 10th\, you can take part
  in an artistic experience\, whether it’s getting hands-on with collage\
 , drawing\, fabric painting and/or crafts\; exploring a wide variety of vi
 sual art while attending art demonstrations and talks\; listening to live 
 music\; improvising through music\, dance\, or spoken word\; or simply rel
 axing at a neighborhood café surrounded by art. Go to https://www.temesca
 larts.com/about-page for schedule\, addreses and details.\nFull Schedule\n
 10/3 Art Is Resilience @ Studio One Art Center (365 45th St.) 12-6pm\n10/4
  Creation Art Show @ Sacred Heart Church (4025 MLK Jr. Way) 12-4pm\nArt & 
 Vinyl Listening @ couchdate (5032 Teleg. Ave.) 4-7pm\nDrag Show & Art @ Ro
 ot’d in the 510 (4444 Teleg. Ave.) 6pm-9pm\n10/6 Improv Night-Music & Po
 etry @ Temescal Art Center (511 48th St.) 7-10pm\nZentangle Drawing @ Teme
 scal Library (5205 Teleg. Ave.) 5-7:30pm\n10/7 Collage Making @ Poems & Pa
 per (4201 Teleg. Ave.) 6-8pm\n10/8 Mixed Media Craft @ E. Bay Depot for Cr
 eative Reuse (4695 Teleg. Ave.) 4-7pm\nBolivian Music with Ajayu@ Tailor I
 t! (4691 Teleg. Ave.) 6-8pm\nMeet Board Game Illustrators @ It’s Your Mo
 ve (4920 B Teleg. Ave.) 7-10pm\n10/9 Interactive Art & TACo Art Show @ Mac
 Art...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.temescalarts.com/about-page\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/oaklands-temescal-arts-community-art-week-oct-3
 10/\nSource: Funcheap SF
