BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“The Tiny Monster Show” Free Art Exhibit + Halloween Costume C
 ontest (Oakland)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639416@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerWhether or not you like monste
 rs\, one has to admit\, most of us like a good scare now and then. Curious
 ly\, the word Monster derives from the Latin “monstrum”\, (divine omen
 \, object of dread). In turn\, “monstrum” is the derivative of “mone
 re”\, (to remind\, warn\, instruct\, or foretell). From this vantage poi
 nt\, monsters take on a new inspiring role\, not to just scare us\, but to
  inform us. So what can monsters teach us about our fears\, our society an
 d beyond?The Tiny Monster Show explores our fears so we can take a deeper 
 look at what we’ve been suppressing and what we need to confront.\nFrom 
 classical to political with a little humor in between\, The Tiny Monster S
 how gives space to capture\, reveal\, and maybe conquer those elements tha
 t keep us frozen in fear and shine a light on what it means to be human. P
 erhaps you’ll experience a moment of laughter in recognition that you ar
 e more powerful than monsters would have you believe.\nArtist Reception Oc
 t. 3rd Noon – 3pmArtist Talk Oct 10th Noon – 2pmClosing Party and Cost
 ume contest Oct. 31st Noon – 4pm\nDanny Soracco\, Spike Milliken\, Karl 
 Hauser\, Diane Komater\, Paulette Traverso\, Artemis Jones\, Nicole Garcia
 \, Case Conover\, Doug Bloch\, Terry Furry\, Doug Rhodes\, Zachary Sweet\,
  Debra Kay Burger\, Jeremy Ian Meyer\, John Colle Rogers\, Patti Goldstein
 \, Jessica Dalton\, Denise Owen\, Ash Volkanic\, Linda Dittes\, Denise Del
 aray\, Lisa McElroy\nCurated by Donna Davis\, UMA Gallery\n\nFree\n\nTicke
 ts: https://www.facebook.com/events/2047180029307188/2047180039307187/?aco
 ntext=%7B%22event_action_history%22%3A%5B%7B%22extra_data%22%3A%22%22%2C%2
 2mechanism%22%3A%22left_rail%22%2C%22surface%22%3A%22bookmark%22%7D%2C%7B%
 22extra_data%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mechanism%22%3A%22surface%22%2C%22surface%22
 %3A%22create_dialog%22%7D%5D%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D&amp\;onload_
 action=open_invite_flow&amp\;show_created_event_toast=true\nDetails: https
 ://sf.funcheap.com/tiny-monster-show-free-art-exhibit-halloween-costume-co
 ntest-oakland/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/The-Ti
 ny-Monster-Show.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:The Grand Gallery Oakland\, 560 2nd St. Oakland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/tiny-monster-show-free-art-exhibit-halloween-c
 ostume-contest-oakland/
END:VEVENT
