DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerJoin us for a 3-hour beginner-
 friendly mending workshop focused on giving your clothes a longer life.\n1
 00% of proceeds will be donated to the American Cancer Society.\nWe’ll l
 earn three practical mending techniques:\n• Sewing on a button\n• Repa
 iring a split seam\n• Patching a hole with visible mending\nThe workshop
  will include a short lesson\, demonstrations\, and hands-on practice with
  materials provided. Then\, either bring 1–2 pieces of clothing you’d 
 like to repair and put your new skills to work with guidance from voluntee
 rs or continue practicing new techniques with provided samples.\nNo experi
 ence or supplies needed! Light snacks and drinks will be provided.\n\n$20.
 00\n\nTickets: https://www.kjfightmasterdesign.com/hey-jude\nDetails: http
 s://sf.funcheap.com/beginner-mending-workshop-repair-clothes-cancer-dogpat
 ch/\nSource: Funcheap SF
