BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Worsening Climate Crisis… Not a Time for Magical Thinking
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639708@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer\n\nPresentation\, film and di
 scussion on the article By Raymond Lotta:\nWorsening Climate Crisis… Not
  a Time for Magical Thinking\,\nConfronting the Reality of the System Dest
 roying the Planet\,\nand Why a Real Revolution Is Our Only Chance of Savin
 g It\nThe catastrophes and suffering caused and exacerbated by global warm
 ing are intensifying and spreading. Wildfires. Record heat. Melting glacie
 rs and polar ice. Oceans hotter and more acidic.\n\nGovernments the world 
 over are failing to meet\, or flat-out abandoning\, pledges to reduce carb
 on emissions rapidly and move decisively away from fossil fuel.\nYet the c
 limate movement is barely to be seen. A major reason is that influential l
 eaders of the climate movement—like Bill McKibben\, Naomi Klein\, and Re
 becca Solnit—have been pushing “magical thinking”:\nMagical Thinking
 \, Act 1: Distort Reality to Tell a More “Positive and Hopeful”Story\n
 Magical Thinking\, Act 2: The Inflation Reduction Act as the Climate Fix o
 f Our Lifetimes\nMagical Thinking\, Act 3: The Fallacy of the Capitalist M
 arket Propelling A Green Energy Transition… Of Cheaper\, Accessible Rene
 wable Energy Beating Out Fossil Fuels\nBut the capitalist-imperialist syst
 em can NOT be pressured and reformed to bring about the necessary green-en
 ergy transition. Fossil fuels are an essential foundation of the whole sys
 tem. Only a revolution guided by the new communism developed by the revolu
 tionary leader Bob Avakian gives us the chance to repair and protect the..
 .\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://revolutionbooks.org\nDetails: https://sf.fun
 cheap.com/worsening-climate-crisis-time-magical-thinking/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/202601
 19_Chile_wildfires_AP26049474233745.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Revolution Books\, 2444 Durant Avenue Berkeley
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/worsening-climate-crisis-time-magical-thinking
 /
END:VEVENT
