DESCRIPTION:SF Tech Week’s Free “DigitalOcean” 8a-8p Downtown Shuttl
 e 2026 (Oct 5-9)\nDigitalOcean offers free hop-on\, hop-off shuttle rides 
 during SF Tech Week\, connecting Caltrain\, BART\, downtown San Francisco\
 , Yerba Buena Gardens\, Embarcadero Plaza\, and select Tech Week locations
 . DigitalOcean-branded coach buses run daily from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM\, wit
 h stops and routes shifting by time of day.\nWHERE TO FIND THE BUS: https:
 //digitaloceanevents.com/\nFree hop-on\, hop-off rides between SF’s tran
 sit hubs and the heart of Tech Week\, all day\, every day.\n\nSF Tech Week
  means back-to-back events\, a dozen neighborhoods\, and a lot of walking.
  Let us take care of the in-between.\nThe DigitalOcean Shuttle is a free h
 op-on\, hop-off ride connecting Caltrain and BART to downtown SF\, lunch\,
  and happy hour. Look for the DigitalOcean coach buses running all week lo
 ng. Grab a seat\, charge your phone\, finish your pitch deck\, and roll up
  to your next event on time.\n– Morning commute (8:00 to 11:00 AM)\nComi
 ng in by train? We’ll meet you there. Catch the shuttle at Caltrain (4th
  & King)\, Montgomery BART\, Embarcadero BART\, or Civic Center BART and r
 ide straight into downtown SF.\n– Midday (11:00 AM to 5:00 PM)\nTake a b
 reak between sessions. The shuttle loops between downtown SF and Yerba Bue
 na Gardens\, so you can grab lunch\, get some sun\, and get back to your n
 ext event without the trek. Keep an eye out around lunchtime. We may have 
 a sweet surprise on the route.\n– Evening (5:00 to 8:00 PM)\nHappy hour 
 is calling....\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://partiful.com/e/yIQsQ8Jo5WG61mmY
 9C7o\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-tech-weeks-free-digitalocean-8a8
 p-downtown-shuttle-2026-oct-59/\nSource: Funcheap SF
