SUMMARY:SF Tech Week: Free “User Experience” Interactive Tech Art Exhi
 bition (Union Square)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T170000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1640522@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Material AlbumUSER EXPERIENCE\, presented by Material Album an
 d Forerunner Ventures\, is a physical exhibition of technology products an
 d passion projects\, on view in San Francisco through November. Software p
 rojects and apps are presented in physical boxes\, a nod to the era when s
 oftware came off a shelf rather than from an App Store. Venture-backed com
 panies sit beside things made just for their makers and friends\, collapsi
 ng the line between commercial viability and personal expression. The show
  traces the aesthetics that echo across generations\, the collision of tec
 hnology and fashion\, and the fog of vision that makes it so hard to tell 
 what will become a hit. It’s physical on purpose.\nUser Experience – G
 allery Night – #SFTechWeek\nhttps://partiful.com/e/7V6xOcDWjV0ax3M47T7T\
 nhttps://userexperience.place/\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://partiful.com/e/
 7V6xOcDWjV0ax3M47T7T\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-tech-week-free-u
 ser-experience-interactive-tech-art-exhibition-union-square/\nSource: Func
 heap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/CleanS
 hot-2026-10-01-at-11.10.34-AM@2x.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:User Experience\, 236 Powell St.\, San Francisco\, CA 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-tech-week-free-user-experience-interactive-
 tech-art-exhibition-union-square/
