DESCRIPTION:Dzu Nguyen\n\nStep back into the shadows for the return of LAS
 T RITUAL\, an immersive\, cocktail experience where every dark corner hold
 s a clue!\n\nHalloween @ Last Rites – A twist around every corner!\nThis
  October\, Last Rites invites guests to step back into the shadows for the
  return of Last Ritual\, an immersive\, month-long cocktail experience whe
 re every drink\, detail\, and dark corner holds a clue.\nIMMERSE YOURSELF\
 , COCKTAIL IN HAND\nLast Ritual: The Relic places guests at the center of 
 a sinister mystery unfolding inside Last Rites. A clue-studded menu introd
 uces six all-new cocktails\, while a transformed atmosphere offers hidden 
 details and visual cues that hint at a story waiting to be uncovered.\n\nU
 ncover the Mystery of the “Relic”\nAt the heart of the experience is T
 he Relic — a mysterious object whose origins are intertwined with the en
 igmatic history of Last Rites itself. Guests are invited to follow the clu
 es\, piece together the story\, uncover the secrets of its characters\, an
 d discover what has been waiting in the shadows.\nDiscover the truth befor
 e time Runs out!\nFrom October 6 through November 1\, enter the world of L
 ast Ritual: The Relic and see how deep the mystery goes.\nNo tickets. No c
 over. No reservations. Just follow the clues.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://
 www.eventbrite.com/e/last-ritual-2026-the-relic-tickets-2001106358988\nDet
 ails: https://sf.funcheap.com/ritual-relic-6-halloween-cocktails-oct-6nov-
 1/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Last-R
 itual-2026-Flyer-square.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Last Rites\, 718 14th St\, San Francisco\, CA 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/ritual-relic-6-halloween-cocktails-oct-6nov-1/
END:VEVENT
