 (regular CD with black & white artwork and a fold-out poster) or Version C
  (regular CD with red & black artwork and a fold-out poster)\, or a combo.
  Maximum one wristband per customer. Space is limited!\n* Each fan must ha
 ve a wristband for entrance to the signing.\n* Limited to two CDs maximum 
 per customer.\n* CDs can be picked up at Amoeba SF the day of the event.\n
