BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Eraserhead Xiu Xiu
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T213000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17422835@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:Xiu Xiu\n\nEraserhead Xiu Xiu\n\nPolyvinyl Record Co.\n\nThurs
 day\, October 8\, 2026\n\n7:30 PM Doors\n\n21+\n\nStanding\n\nView our FAQ
  page for more info\, or contact us at [email protected] with any accommod
 ation requests.\n\nIn 2016\, with the blessing of David Lynch and Angelo B
 adalamenti\, Xiu Xiu released and toured the surprisingly successful album
  and concert\, Plays the Music of Twin Peaks. Out of respect and deference
  to the beloved series\, the band decided to put the concert to rest in 20
 18. After the recent and untimely passing of David Lynch\, Xiu Xiu began t
 o receive several high-profile requests to revive their interpretation of 
 this iconic music. However\, in wanting to always try to follow\, honor\, 
 and continue to be inspired by the incredibly high bar of artistic challen
 ge set by David Lynch\, Xiu Xiu is instead going deeper.\n\nEraserhead Xiu
  Xiu is a new live concert with accompanying film & full-length album that
  uses field recordings\, concert specific homemade instruments\, organ\, m
 odular synths\, vocals\, flashlights\, electrical interference\, and eleme
 nts of musique concrete to express the bizarre emotionality\, conflicted s
 exuality\, relentless darkness\, and singularly unsettled moonscape of thi
 s most incredible of midnight masterpieces. The album itself is a masterpi
 ece in sound collage and experimentation\, with tracks like “Tetra” an
 d “Sleep Synth” shifting from minimal auditory sensations to a clobber
 ing\, grotesque cacophony. The album’s closing track\, “In Heaven\,”
  is a beautiful...\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/8/erase
 rhead-xiu-xiu-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7544054;-122.4183493
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32426373/9ccab40f-877b-44bd-966a-70df800144bb.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Gray Area\, 2665 Mission Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/8/eraserhead-xiu-xiu-tickets
END:VEVENT
