SUMMARY:Remains a Memory
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639666@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerLara AburamadanRemains a Memor
 y is a still photo collection from Gaza City\, encapsulating a placethat h
 olds stories of the land and the sea. Within the frames\, serene moments u
 nfold against a backdrop that longs for genuine peace—a rarity in the ar
 tist’s hometown.\nIn this show\, Lara Aburamadan explores the transforma
 tion of memories of home shaped by the relentless impact of war\, transiti
 oning from tangible reality to the ethereal realms of daydreams and nostal
 gia. Having lived in exile for years\, Aburamadan is left pondering the un
 certain path ahead\, questioning the fate of a Gaza that clings to memorie
 s of people and places that don’t exist anymore.\n\nREMAINS A MEMORY FIL
 M\n“Experience the essence of Gaza in ‘Remains a Memory\, a short docu
 mentary captured in seven-second vines spanning 2014 to 2016. Filmed from 
 the artist’s balcony\, now obliterated\, the sea\, fishermen\, farmers\,
  food\, nightscapes\, changing seasons\, and the poignant borders and stre
 ets\, these glimpses into daily life\, the aftermath of the 2014 war\, are
  a visual journey into the heart of a homeland forever altered. With each 
 fleeting scene\, the artist invites you to witness the warmth and nostalgi
 a that bursts forth from her memories. As Gaza stands transformed\, these 
 seven-second clips become a testament to resilience and an ode to a time w
 hen life persisted against the backdrop of destruction\, now eternally etc
 hed in the artist’s evocative recollections.”\nLara explores the trans
 ...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/autonomous.gallery?stkn=
 NXppZm0yOTBrb2pz&amp\;utm_source=qr\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/rema
 ins-memory/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Copy-o
 f-Remains-a-Memory.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Autonomous Gallery\, 419 Georgia st\, ste 8
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/remains-memory/
END:VEVENT
