 he Dead Reckoning Podcast is coming to Paxton Gate San Francisco for a liv
 e show.\nHistorian Elizabeth Creely and Dead Reckoning will be at the stor
 e for a live exploration of the neighborhood’s deadly past\, featuring s
 tories of death\, phantoms in the night\, and the dark history lurking rig
 ht here in our own neighborhood. If you’re looking to learn more about S
 an Francisco’s spooky side\, or just want to be creeped out the next tim
 e you’re walking down Valencia at night\, then this is definitely for yo
