SUMMARY:Wildlife Conservation Expo
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T120000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17794987@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:This October\, the Wildlife Conservation Network will gather t
 ogether the most remarkable conservationists in the field\, and give you a
  chance to connect with them. At the Wildlife Conservation Expo\, conserva
 tionists on the front lines will bring you into their world—sharing firs
 thand stories in candid presentations and one-on-one conversations. Join u
 s\, connect with them\, and be inspired.\n\nStories You Won't Hear Anywher
 e Else:\nTravel from the golden savannas of Africa to the icy shores of An
 tarctica in the span of an afternoon. Conservationists will give you an ex
 clusive look behind the scenes of their work—the daily challenges\, the 
 threats they're racing against\, and the breakthroughs that give them hope
 . And remember to bring your questions with you\, because this is your cha
 nce to ask them directly.\n\nMeet Conservationists from Across the Globe:\
 nPut faces to the stories. Between sessions\, you'll be able to speak dire
 ctly with the conservationists presenting—ask a follow-up question\, lea
 rn more about their work\, or simply thank them for what they do. It's an 
 opportunity for real connection that goes far beyond any presentation or t
 alk.\n\nDiscover International Artisans:\nStep into a marketplace where ev
 ery purchase means something. Browse handcrafted treasures from artisans a
 round the world\, and know that in bringing home a piece of their story\, 
 you're also supporting their communities and the conservation work that pr
 otects the landscapes they call home.\n\nCelebrate with a Comm...\n\n$80\n
 Wildlife Conservation Network\n\nTickets: https://events.wcnexpo.org/en/6A
 2fTG6/2026-wildlife-conservation-expo-5a3tQh5Xh89/overview\nDetails: https
 ://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/10/wildlife-conservation-expo-tickets\nSour
 ce: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34199159/9294b624-150e-479e-a951-ffafbef1676c.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Mission Bay Conference Center\, San Francisco\, 1675 Owens Street
 \, San Francisco\, CA\, 94158
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/10/wildlife-conservation-expo-tick
 ets
END:VEVENT
