BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Step Into Wonder – Deep Dive Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1634419@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerPriscila Soares\n\nGo beyond t
 he surface of creativity with Step Into Wonder: Deep Dive\, an intimate\, 
 guided art experience for adults at Mare Island Art Studios.\nLed by artis
 t Priscila Soares\, this three-hour session uses art-making\, creative pro
 mpts and reflection to explore what happens when we quiet the inner critic
 \, let go of expectations and give ourselves permission to create freely.\
 n\nNo artistic experience is needed. The focus isn’t on making something
  “good”—it’s on curiosity\, expression and discovering what can em
 erge when you stop trying to control the outcome.\nSet within the immersiv
 e Step Into Wonder installation\, surrounded by glowing sculptures and a t
 ransformed gallery environment\, the Deep Dive offers a smaller\, more int
 entional experience for those who want to explore the deeper side of The L
 etting Go Art Experience.\nCome as you are. Get messy. Follow your intuiti
 on. See what happens when you let go.\nOctober 10 & 24 • 10 AM–1 PM18+
  • $45 • Limited to 15 participantsMare Island Art Studios\, 110 Pinta
 do St.\, Vallejo\n\n$45.00\n\nTickets: https://thelettinggoartexperience.c
 om/all-events/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/step-deep-dive-workshop/\
 nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/step-i
 nto-wonder-deep-dive-fb-banner.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Mare Island Art Studios\, 110 Pintado St. Vallejo
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/step-deep-dive-workshop/
END:VEVENT
