 ays – $22\nWednesdays and Thursdays – $18\n\nDiscounts for kids\, stud
 ents\, seniors and family packages.\n\nBrowse the on-site retail store for
  collector’s editions\, out-of-print kits and rare finds. Perfect for gi
 ft-givers and serious collectors alike. Please note:\nBrick Exhibition is 
 a fan exhibit not organised or administered by the LEGO Group. Get your ti
 ckets now for Brick Exhibition in San Francisco!\n\n$22.00\n\nTickets: htt
