DESCRIPTION:Galería de la RazaGalería de la Raza’s Lunada New Moon Fes
 t marks the 25th anniversary of Lunada Literary Lounge and serves as the f
 inal stop of Litquake’s ¡Poetry on la Veinti Cuatro! crawl. The free ev
 ent features poetry and spoken-word performances\, musica\, an open mic\, 
 a DJ and local vendors at Studio 24 in the Mission.\nOriginal Event Descri
 ption:\n_🌌 🌒 Celebrate 25 years of literary magic under the moon at 
 Lunada New Moon Fest!\nMark your calendars for our final conjuring of the 
 year happening on Saturday\, October 10th. Lunada’s last celebration of 
 the year will also be the final stop of ¡Poetry on la Veinti Cuatro! for 
 this year’s Litquake.\nCurated by Josiah Luis Alderete ¡Poetry on la Ve
 inti Cuatro! is a 24th Street poetry crawl celebrating three Mission readi
 ng series that have been integral in shaping this neighborhood’s deep li
 terary history: Poets in the Window at Medicine for Nightmares\, Pan Dulce
  Poets at La Reyna Bakery\, and La Lunada at Galería de la Raza.\nJoin us
  to cap off the day with even more performances curated by Norman Zelaya\,
  a DJ\, and vendors. We hope to see you there!\n⏰ Saturday\, October 10\
 , 5 PM\n📍Galería de la Raza Studio 24\n2779 Folsom St. Ste. A\nSan Fra
 ncisco\, CA 94110\n#galeriadelaraza #mission #lunada\nFor the past 25 year
 s\, Lunada Literary Lounge has gathered on the full moon to honor spoken w
 ord\, poetry\, musica\, and literatura. On its silver anniversary\, Galer
 ía will instead gather under the new moon\, holding three seasonal gather
 ings\; the final...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/DdSA-F
 VSfgo/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp\;stkn=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==\nDetails: ht
 tps://sf.funcheap.com/lunadas-moon-fest-2026-25th-anniversary-lit-poetry-n
 ight-mission/\nSource: Funcheap SF
