UID:funcheap-1636948@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerRich GosseJoin us for an excit
 ing evening of speed dating designed specifically for singles ages 40s/50s
 . Meet new friends\, 5 minutes at a time\, at an upscale hotel! Dress to i
 mpress. Whether you’re looking for a soulmate or just a new friend\, thi
 s is the perfect place to spark a connection.\nDISCOUNT TICKETS: $30/early
  birds. $45/advance. $55/door\, if space permits. Tickets for women are so
 ld out.\nWHEN: Saturday\, Oct 10\, 7:00 PM – 9:00 PM.\nWHERE: Hotel Zepp
 elin\, 545 Post St\, San Francisco CA. We request that everyone purchase a
 t least one drink\, so this fun venue invites us back.\nSCHEDULE:\n6:45 pm
  – 7:00 pm Registration.\n7:00 pm – 7:15 pm Speed Dating Introduction\
 n7:15 pm – 9:00 pm Speed Dating\nYour spot will be given away if you hav
 e not checked in by 7:15 PM.\nCO-SPONSORED by The Society of Single Profes
 sionals\, Singles Bay Area\, and dozens of singles organizations and meetu
