 e of pleasure. Tantra is the art of tapping into Pleasure. In this worksho
 p you’ll learn to contact your Pleasure Body\, the subtle\, invisible bo
 dy that lives between consciousness and flesh. It’s available to you any
 time\, anywhere\, under any circumstances\, and it deepens dramatically wh
 en you share it with another person.\nLed by Alicia & Erwan Davon\, the Sa
 n Francisco Bay Area’s leading Tantra teachers\, with 30+ years and over
