 t quiet mental agitation and ease physical pain\n❤️‍ Honest work on 
 what gets in the way: psychological blocks\, social ones\, even finding th
 e time\n❤️‍ A set of daily practices you take home and can do alone 
 or with a partner\, the k...\n\n$54.00\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.
