DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerNathan Stanley’s “Personal
  Tribute to Dr. Ralph Stanley” is a heartfelt celebration of the life\, 
 legacy\, and timeless music of his grandfather\, the legendary bluegrass p
 ioneer Dr. Ralph Stanley. Carrying forward the Stanley family tradition\, 
 Nathan honors the songs\, stories\, and spirit that made Dr. Ralph Stanley
  an icon of American music. With his powerful voice\, deep connection to t
 he music\, and personal memories from a lifetime around his grandfather\, 
 Nathan brings audiences an unforgettable evening filled with authentic blu
 egrass\, emotion\, and Appalachian heritage. A Dove Award winner\, Grammy 
 nominee\, and ICM Award winner\, Nathan Stanley continues the mission of p
 reserving and sharing the music that helped inspire generations. His tribu
 te show celebrates not only the remarkable career of Dr. Ralph Stanley\, b
 ut also the family bond and musical legacy that continues to live on. Don
 ’t miss this heartfelt tribute honoring one of bluegrass music’s great
 est legends\, performed by the grandson who knew him best. Nathan Stanley 
 was the last lead singer for Dr. Ralph Stanley & The Clinch Mountain Boys.
  Tickets are $35 in advance\, $40 at the door general admission\; $30 for 
 student/low income individuals. Children under 12 are free. Advance ticket
 s are available here\, or if the show is not sold out\, you may purchase y
 our tickets at the door before the show. Doors open 30 minutes before show
  time. We accept cash or Venmo only at the door.\n\n$35.00\n\nTickets: htt
 ps://www.eventvesta.com/events/160689-a-special-tribute-to-dr-ralph-stanle
 y-starring-nathan-stanley-constant-sorrow\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.co
