DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMETHEMATIC ENTERTAINMENT x PRO
 PER TINGS PRESENT: DR. USHŪU & TWO SWORDS\nTwo worlds of bass music colli
 de in San Francisco this October as Thematic Entertainment and Propertings
  join forces for a heavyweight night with two artists who have been pushin
 g the boundaries of underground electronic music from the opposite sides o
 f the Atlantic. At the center of it all: Dr. Ushūu and Two Swords\, backe
 d by a handpicked lineup of local support.\n\nDR. USHŪU\nFew artists have
  had a more interesting year than Dr. Ushūu.\nThe French bass music produ
 cer has spent the last year reinventing himself\, moving beyond the heavie
 r dubstep sound he became known for and diving headfirst into deeper\, mor
 e dance-focused 140 music. His “Camden Town” era has become a major tu
 rning point\, with the track and its surrounding rollout helping propel a 
 new wave of attention around the Ushūu project. He has openly described t
 his period as rediscovering why he makes music in the first place\, and th
 at energy is impossible to miss.\nHis rise has been backed by some serious
  credentials. Dr. Ushūu has appeared at major festivals including Lost La
 nds and Rampage\, while his releases and performances have continued to bu
 ild an international following.\nNow sitting at more than 65\,000 monthly 
 Spotify listeners\, with a string of 2026 releases behind him\, Dr. Ushūu
  is entering one of the most exciting chapters of his career. Expect deep 
 140 pressure\, ridiculous sound design\, heavy low end and th...\n\n$5.00\
 n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/thematic-entertainment-x-proper-t
 ings-present-dr-ushuu-two-swords-tickets-1999280264089\nDetails: https://s
 f.funcheap.com/thematic-entertainment-proper-tings-present-dr-ushu-swords/
 \nSource: Funcheap SF
