DESCRIPTION:Join Indivisible San Francisco\, 50501SF\, and our coalition f
 or a mass march to VOTE EARLY TOGETHER\, urge our neighbors to vote\, and 
 show our power in numbers in the heart of San Francisco.\n\nWe will gather
  at 1 PM at 18th and Dolores Streets. Our rolling block party will move th
 rough the Mission ending at 7th and Mission Streets. If you'd like to join
  us in making a visual statement of the power of early voting\, bring your
  completed ballot to continue three blocks along the Mission St sidewalk t
 o drop your ballot in the Ballot Box at Jessie Sq. Signs\, pins\, clothes\
 , etc. that promote a party or candidate cannot be displayed within 100 ft
  of a Ballot Box under California elections law. Please respect this rule 
 and help keep us out of trouble. You and a friend could take turns\, or yo
 u could leave these items briefly with our volunteers at Jessie Square.\n\
 nWe hope you'll join us to demonstrate democracy\, solidarity\, and streng
 th against authoritarianism.\n\nSan Francisco\, don't wait to place your v
 ote. Join Indivisible SF\, 50501SF and our coalition to vote early and get
  ready for election defense.\n\nWe decide who represents us. We decide wha
 t comes next. Join us to show it's the people who have the power!\n\nFree\
 n\nTickets: https://www.mobilize.us/nokings/event/1020762/\nDetails: https
 ://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/no-kings-vote-early-march-tickets\nSourc
 e: DoTheBay
