DESCRIPTION:Priscila Soares\n\ntep Into Wonder comes alive after dark for 
 an immersive\, adults-only night of glowing art\, music\, movement\, creat
 ivity and connection at Mare Island Art Studios.\nWander through galleries
  transformed by UV light\, illuminated sculptures and fantastical handmade
  installations. Make art\, interact with the evolving environment\, move t
 o the music\, play\, explore and see where your curiosity takes you.\nThis
  is not your typical gallery night. After Dark invites you to loosen up\, 
 participate and become part of the art—whether you come ready to create\
 , dance\, connect with others or simply experience the unexpected.\nCreate
 d by artist Priscila Soares and The Letting Go Art Experience\, After Dark
  is a celebration of creativity without rules and the magic that happens w
 hen we give ourselves permission to play.\nSaturday\, October 17 • 7–1
 1 PM18+ • $20Mare Island Art Studios\, 110 Pintado St.\, Vallejo\n\n$20.
 00\n\nTickets: https://thelettinggoartexperience.com/all-events/\nDetails:
  https://sf.funcheap.com/step-uv-glowing-art-dark-party-mare-island/\nSour
 ce: Funcheap SF
