DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, October 18\, 2026\, 4:30 pm - 9:30 pm\n\nJoin Foodwis
 e for our most important night of the year\, bringing together farmers\, c
 hefs\, and change makers in supporting a just\, regenerative\, and delicio
 us food future. At Sunday Supper: A Farm to City Feast\, youll enjoy an ab
 undant walkaround reception and elegant seated four-course dinner at San F
 ranciscos iconic Ferry Building\, showcasing the freshest fall produce fro
 m Foodwises farmers markets. Support local farms\, community food access\,
  and youth education\, and do it deliciously.\n\nKick off the night with h
 ors doeuvres\, hand-crafted drinks\, and a behind-the-scenes peek at the a
 ction-packed kitchen.\n\nGather in the Grand Hall as the citys top chefs p
 resent unforgettable menus using the seasons bounty\, paired with speciall
 y selected California wines.\n\nTake home one-of-a-kind packages such as e
 xquisite private dinners with acclaimed chefs\, luxurious getaways\, and e
 xclusive food experiences.\n\nNew this year! Weve added a limited number o
 f reception-only tickets\, so that more guests can enjoy the lavish hors d
 oeuvres and hand-crafted drinks. The reception will take place in front of
  the Ferry Building from 4:30 to 6:00 pm (seated four-course dinner not in
 cluded).\n\nProceeds provide vital funds for Foodwises work championing an
  equitable and sustainable Bay Area food community through farmers markets
  and education programs. This event also supports our treasured restaurant
  community\, and a portion of your ticket price will underwrite...\n\nTick
 ets: https://foodwise.org/events/foodwise-sunday-supper/\nDetails: https:/
 /dothebay.com/events/2026/10/18/foodwise-sunday-supper-tickets-xmrv1wk\nSo
