DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSF Arcade Bar “Emporium” 8
  Free Game Tokens for “Industry Night” (Every Monday)\nEmporium SF\nEm
 porium Arcade Bar San Francisco\, the dynamic venue known for its classic 
 arcade games\, colorful\, fun-loving atmosphere\, and renowned drink menu\
 , now offers 8 free game tokens for anyone in “the industry” – so we
 ’re assuming barstaff\, restaurant staff\, nightlife staff.\nMonday Nigh
