SUMMARY:Sewing 101: Hemming and Simple Repairs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17828621@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:- Class Time: 7:00PM - 10:00PM\n\nKeeping your wardrobe in goo
 d shape starts with learning a few basic repairs and alterations. Maybe yo
 u need to shorten a pair of pants with a new hem\, fix a seam that has spl
 it open\, or sew a button back on. In this beginner-friendly class\, you w
 ill learn hand sewing techniques to keep your favorite clothes ready to we
 ar!\n\nLessons covered in this class include:\n\n- Hemming jeans\, stretch
  fabrics\, and delicate sheers\n\n- Repairing seams\n\n- Sewing on buttons
 \n\n- Simple mending techniques\n\nDuring class\, you will practice using 
 a selection of different fabrics. We also encourage you to bring a few ite
 ms of your own to work on if you like. Your instructor will guide you thro
 ugh all hemming and repair techniques but will not directly mend your sele
 cted items. That's where you come in!! Each student will gain a working kn
 owledge of each hemming and repair techniques\, as well as the opportunity
  to work on 1-2 pieces from home.\n\nPlease Note: This is a beginner-frien
 dly class that does not require prior hand or machine sewing knowledge. Ho
 wever\, this would not be a replacement for one of our other Sewing 101 or
  Sewing Bootcamp classes\, which give a more complete introduction to usin
 g sewing machines. Also\, this class will not cover replacing / repairing 
 zippers\, as that's a whole 'nother thing!!\n\nSupplies Needed: All materi
 als for practice are provided so you can try out several techniques on dif
 ferent types of fabric. You may bring a few pieces from home...\n\n$59.75\
 n\nTickets: https://etix.prf.hn/click/camref:1011l3GdWo/pubref:dostuff/des
 tination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.etix.com%2Fticket%2Fp%2F32363770%2Fsewing-101he
 mming-and-simple-repairs-san-francisco-workshopsf\nDetails: https://dotheb
 ay.com/events/2026/10/19/sewing-101-hemming-and-simple-repairs-tickets\nSo
 urce: DoTheBay
