DESCRIPTION:After Dark: Death and Life / La muerte y la vida\nThursday\, O
 ctober 22 | Exploratorium\, Pier 15\n\nHow do you feel about death? Join u
 s for an evening of fascinating talks\, thought-provoking exhibits\, and h
 ands-on activities that celebrate and investigate the circle of life. Disc
 over what scientists have learned about life from death. Dive into differe
 nt approaches to end-of-life\, and honor Día de los Muertos with a dazzli
 ng altar created by the Marigold Project.\n\nCelebrate Día de los Muertos
  and get curious about the culture (and taboo) around the circle of life.\
 n\nAfter Dark Thursday Nights\nThis event is part of our After Dark Thursd
 ay Nights series. Unplug and play with 700+ interactive exhibits exploring
  science\, art\, and perception. Learn more.\n\n6–10 p.m.\nAdults Only (
 Ages 18+)\nThe Exploratorium\, Pier 15\, San Francisco\n\n18+\n\nTickets: 
 https://www.exploratorium.edu/visit/calendar/after-dark-death-and-life\nDe
 tails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/after-dark-death-and-life-la
