 et/34760492/6b769334-9fe2-4599-996d-cb6fbb8eecbe.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Koret Auditorium (SF Public Library)\, 100 Larkin St\, San Franci
 sco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/presentation-eyewitness-to-the-
 resistance-tickets
END:VEVENT
