DESCRIPTION:A great Halloween costume deserves more than one night.\n\nOn 
 Saturday\, October 24\, 2026\, CrawlSF is giving San Francisco an extra ch
 ance to dress up with the opening event of its four-day Halloween Pub Craw
 l. The party takes place one week before Halloween and includes more than 
 20 bars\, drink specials\, DJs\, contests\, party favors and activities.\n
 \nThe event runs from 4PM to 10PM\, starting with check-in at Mayes Oyster
  House. Located at 1233 Polk Street\, Mayes will serve as the place where 
 participants collect their official wristbands before visiting the remaini
 ng bars.\n\nOnce check-in is complete\, guests can arrange the evening aro
 und their own interests. There is no required order for visiting locations
  and no single group that everyone must follow. Participants can remain at
  one bar for a while\, make a quick tour of several stops or meet differen
 t groups of friends at locations along the route.\n\nThe participating lin
 eup includes neighborhood bars\, restaurants\, dance spots and music venue
 s. Official locations include Mayes Oyster House\, Union Street Ale House\
 , Route 101\, El Lopo\, Rick & Roxy’s\, Hanaro\, The Blue Light\, Jaxson
 \, Decodance\, Beso Mae\, Lush Lounge\, R Bar\, Uni Pizza\, Wizards & Wand
 s\, Campus\, White Rabbit\, Silver Cloud\, Music City Starfactory\, Sacred
  Taco\, Comet Club\, Rockwell\, McTeague’s Saloon and Westwood.\n\nEach 
 bar offers another place to show off costumes\, take group photos and meet
  other Halloween fans. Some participants may arrive in matching group cost
 umes\, w...\n\n$12 to $45\, 21+\nCrawlSF Presents:\n\nTickets: https://cra
 wlsf.com/events/crawloween-san-francisco-halloween-pub-crawl/\nDetails: ht
 tps://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/san-francisco-halloween-bar-crawl-202
 6-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
