DESCRIPTION:Haunted Howl-o-ween Party for Dogs at Wag Hotels San Francisco
 \nCome for the costumes. Stay for the cause. Join us on Saturday\, Oct. 24
  from 6–8 PM for a howling good time benefiting at-risk senior dogs!\n\n
 Grab your pup\, plan your costumes and join us for an evening of Halloween
  fun with plenty of heart! Wag Hotels’ 11th Annual Haunted Howl-o-ween P
 aw-ty returns on Saturday\, October 24\, from 6–8 PM (updated time!) for
  a spooktacular celebration the whole family can enjoy.\n\nBest of all\, 1
 00% of event proceeds will benefit The Grey Muzzle Organization and its wo
 rk to improve the lives of at-risk senior dogs. Together\, we can help mor
 e pups receive the care\, comfort and love they need and deserve in their 
 golden years.\n\nGet ready for a howling good time filled with:\nA Costume
  Contest with paw-some prizes\nFan-favorite Photos with Cruella de Vil\nHa
 lloween-themed activities and fun for dogs and kids\nLocal vendors\nDIY Pu
 ppuccino bar\nTemporary pet tattoos\nTrick-or-treating\, and more!\nCostum
 e Contest\n\nDress to impress and compete for prizes in one of three categ
 ories:\nMost Spooktacular — Scariest costume\nCutest Pawtners — Pet Pa
 rent and Dog duo\nBest in Show — Most impressive overall\nSupport Senior
  Dogs Through Our Online Auction!\nThe fun—and the opportunity to give b
 ack—extends beyond the Paw-ty! Our online Silent Auction will feature a 
 curated collection of exciting prizes and experiences\, with proceeds bene
 fiting The Grey Muzzle Organization.\n\nFrom October 10–24\, supporters 
 near and f...\n\nWag Hotels presents:\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/
 APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fhaunted-howl-o-ween-party-
 for-dogs-at-wag-hotels-san-francisco-tickets-2001079595939\nDetails: https
