  our Koret Education Center\, located on Floor 2\, plus additional perform
 ances\, activations\, and more. While the museum is always free for visito
 rs 18 and younger\, on Free Family Day\, General admission to the museum i
 s free for up to two adults accompanying one child or teen (18 and younger
 )\, and tickets are available two weeks in advance. Surcharged exhibitions
  are not included and require separate paid tickets.\nSFMOMA’s Free Fami
 ly Day\nSunday\, October 25\, 2026 | 10 am to 5 pm\nSFMOMA\, 151 Third St.
 \, SF\nFREE for up to two adults accompanying each visitor under 18.\n\nUp
  to two adults may each claim a free ticket when accompanied by a visitor 
 18 and younger on Free Family Day. Reserve your free tickets when they bec
 ome available.\n\nAdmission to special exhibitions that require a surcharg
 e is not included (but may be purchased for an additional fee)\nIf you arr
 ive unaccompanied by someone 18 or under\, you’ll need to purchase ticke
 ts.\nRead the Free Family Day FAQ\n\nEvent schedule and ticket reservation
 s typically become available two weeks before each Free Family Day.\n\nFre
