 et/34356733/64950b6a-6159-4d88-8382-5a7519043765.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Workshop\, 1310 Haight St\, San Francisco \, CA\, 94115
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/25/beginner-s-leatherworking-craft
 -your-own-tri-fold-leather-journal-tickets
