  time with us!\n\nThis vinyasa yoga classes combine accessible and creativ
 e flows\, dynamic stretching\, and core work. All-levels flow moves at a s
 teady\, accessible pace so you can slow down\, connect to each movement an
 d breath\, while still offering some challenge. Headphones are provided to
  create an immersive sound experience\, so it’s easy to hear the teacher
 \, to stay present with the practice\, and to enjoy a mix of zen and fun s
 oulful beats!\n\nPlease bring your own mat.\n\nTickets: https://www.ferryb
