UID:dothebay-17821504@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Arts & Family
DESCRIPTION:This is Your City. This is Your Voice. This is Your Future. Sh
 are your story about growing up and raising your family in San Francisco.\
 n\nEvery family has a story. Every voice matters. Please share yours.\n\nJ
 oin us for the District 11 Excelsior Family Summit! The This Is Your City:
  Family Summit Series invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and c
 ommunity members from across San Francisco to help shape the future of our
  city.\n\nThursday\, Oct. 29\, 2026\, 5:30 p.m. - 8:00 p.m.\n\nIslais Plac
 e\, 4840 Mission St. SF\, CA 94112\n\nFree food\, childcare\, and interpre
 tation are provided. Please note all interpretation requests must be made 
 48 hours or more prior to the Family Summit.\n\nWho should attend? Everyon
 e is welcome. This event highlights District 11\, but you can attend any F
 amily Summit that fits your schedule.\n\nWhy are we gathering? The Family 
 Summit Series is part of San Francisco's first Citywide Community Needs As
 sessment. Through conversations with families across the city\, we're lear
 ning what matters most to children\, youth\, young adults\, and families. 
 What we learn will help improve future planning\, programs\, and services.
 \n\nWhether you've lived in San Francisco your whole life or recently made
  it your home\, your experiences and ideas matter.\n\nDistrict 11 Neighbor
 hoods include: Excelsior\, Crocker Amazon\, Outer Mission\, Mission Terrac
 e\, Oceanview\, Ingleside\, Ingleside Heights\, Merced Heights\n\nFree\nSa
 n Francisco Department of Children\, Youth & Their Families (DCYF)\n\nTick
 ets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe
 %2Fdistrict-11-excelsior-family-summit-tickets-1996547093101%3Faff%3Doddtd
 tcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/29/district-11-exce
 lsior-family-summit-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https:
 //sf.funcheap.com/district-11-excelsior-family-summit/
