  spooky Halloween toppers. We’ll also have fake blood and all the creepy
  magic you can imagine to make your cute li’l terrariums into creepy TER
 RORARIUMS that will DEF make your Halloween party or Halloween fun.\n\nSup
 plies needed: None. We will provide all glass vessels\, succulents\, creep
 y Halloween figures\, and all the things. If you would like to bring one o
 f your own glass jars or vases\, feel free! You may also bring your own su
 cculents if you have any favorites\, as well as you are welcome to bring y
