DESCRIPTION:Hayes Valley’s Glowing Halloween “Trick-or-Treat Trail” 
 + Free Outdoor Movie (2026)\nHVMC / HVNA\nFriday\, October 30th\, after sc
 hool bring the kids in costume all around Hayes Valley for the merchant Tr
 ick-or-Treat Trail. Then stroll over to Hayes Promenade for entertainment\
 , glowing sculptures\, and a free outdoor movie in Hayes Valley!\n️ EVEN
 T SCHEDULE:\n4–6pm | Trick-or-Treat Trail Follow the “ghost” window 
 clings to pick up treats from participating merchants! Plus—thanks to a 
 grant from Avenue Greenlight—enjoy giant illuminated sculptures from Ast
 ro Botanicals on the Hayes Promenade\, face painting by Suzy\, live music 
 by Brendan Getzell\, and Sterling Bubbles.\n\n6–7pm | Dinner & Shopping 
 Break Stick around to shop local and grab dinner or grab-and-go specials f
 rom neighborhood restaurants before the film.\n7:30–9pm | Free Film at P
 ROXY Claim your spot starting at 7pm with picnic blankets for a free scree
 ning of Minions & Monsters! (Big thanks to sponsors Absinthe Brasserie & B
 ar\, Arbor Café\, Arlequin Wine Merchant\, PROXY\, and Signature Innovati
 on Group!)\n4–10pm | Entertainment Zone (21+) Sip and stroll! Check out 
 hayespromenade.org for participating bars and restaurants.\nWhere: All ove
 r Hayes Valley\, the Hayes Promenade & PROXY (Hayes Valley\, SF)\n️ Admi
 ssion: FREE & open to all\nDetails + map: explorehayesvalley.org/halloween
 -trick-or-treat-trail\nProduced by the Hayes Valley Merchants Council & th
 e Hayes Valley Neighborhood Association\n#HVMC # Explorehayesvalley #Hallo
 weenOnHayes...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.explorehayesvalley.org/hall
 oween-trick-or-treat-trail\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/hayes-valleys
 -glowing-halloween-trickortreat-trail-free-outdoor-movie-2026/\nSource: Fu
 ncheap SF
