 dmission is $33.66\, but Bay Area adults w/ valid ID get 15% off tickets p
 urchased in person (not valid online) so they’ll pay around $29 and get 
 around $5 off.\nOriginal Event Description:\nSomething spooky is swimming 
 into the Bay! 🎃🌊\nJoin us for Fish or Treat\, October 31–November 
 1 at PIER 39!\nPIER 39 The Embarcadero &\, Beach St\, San Francisco\, CA 9
 4133\nOctober 31-November 1\, 2026\n🎃 Underwater Pumpkin Carving | 1–
