 er wearing a costume receive FREE admission October 31–November 1.*\nGen
 eral Admission for adult is $33.66 – but bay area locals can get 15% off
  tickets with valid ID – only for purchase in person (locals discount no
 t available for online purchases) – so adults would be approximately $28
 .61 – about $5 off\nLocals Discount\nIf you live in one of the nine San 
