DESCRIPTION:Make Sunday\, November 1\, 2026\, a night to remember at Crawl
 SF’s Dia De Los Muertos Pub Crawl—the spectacular closing chapter of t
 he four-day Crawloween 2026 event.\n\nRunning from 4PM to 10PM\, this uniq
 uely themed pub crawl lets you continue the Halloween festivities while em
 bracing the rich cultural traditions of Día de los Muertos.\n\nCheck in a
 t the historic Mayes Oyster House (1233 Polk Street\, San Francisco\, CA 9
 4109) and gain free access to participating bars including Mayes\, McTeagu
 e’s\, El Lopo\, Wreck Room\, Uni Pizza\, Decodance\, Lush Lounge\, Beso 
 Mae\, and more. Throughout the evening you’ll find drink specials\, DJs 
 keeping the dance floors packed\, free party favors\, lively contests\, an
 d an atmosphere filled with celebration. Feel free to rock your best Hallo
 ween costume or dress in respectful Día de los Muertos style—traditiona
 l calavera face painting and attire are encouraged when worn to honor the 
 holiday’s spirit of remembrance and joy.\n\nWhether you’re a longtime 
 Crawloween fan or joining for the first time\, this final day offers the p
 erfect mix of spooky fun and meaningful cultural celebration across San Fr
 ancisco’s Polk Street corridor and beyond.\n\nTickets\n\n$12 to $35\, 21
  and over event\nCrawlSF Presents:\n\nTickets: https://crawlsf.com/events/
 san-francisco-halloween-pub-crawl-day-of-the-dead/\nDetails: https://dothe
 bay.com/events/2026/11/1/halloween-pub-crawl-dia-de-los-muertos-tickets\nS
