BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Loco Bloco Presents: Día De Los Muertos 2026 - Esto No Se Vende
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261102T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261102T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17924089@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Brava Presents\n\nNovember 1\, 2025\n\n10:00AM Altares Viewing
 \n\nShowtimes: 2:00PM & 6:00PM\n\nBrava Main Stage\n\nSF Loco Bloco dancer
 s\, drummers & band Cuicacalli Dance Company Lanakila Mangauil Ho’a Hawa
 ii Christelle Durandy Odoiya Women's Chorus and the Sweet Xequere Big star
  circus.\n\nStep into a living ofrenda! In partnership with Brava Theater\
 , Loco Bloco presents “Esto No Se Vende\,” an electrifying Día de los
  Muertos celebration where live music\, dance\, ceremony\, and storytellin
 g ignite the stage. Bay Area artists and communities come together to hono
 r our ancestors\, celebrate resilience\, and move toward new life.\n\n“E
 sto No Se Vende” (This We Do Not Sell) celebrates Dia de los Muertos at 
 the historic Brava Theater in the Latino Cultural District of San Francisc
 o. Produced by Loco Bloco\, this annual event offers unique interpretation
 s of Dia de los Muertos themes by artists from Mexican\, Central American\
 , African-American\, Caribbean and other communities rooted in San Francis
 co and the Bay Area. Mainstage performers include: Loco Bloco Performing E
 nsemble\, Cuicacalli Dance Company\, Christelle Durandy\, Lanakila Manguai
 l and Odoiya Women’s Chorus.\n\nOn this sacred day\, Brava Theater trans
 forms to a living “ofrenda” with altares by community artists and orga
 nizations in the lobby and danza azteca ceremony in front. Both performers
  and the audience experience a moving cross-cultural dialogue\, finding co
 mmon ground that honors ancestors\, addresses loss\, and envisions new lif
 e.\n\nTicket...\n\nTickets: https://brava.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/%
 23/events/a0SPa00000dhKTFMA2%20can%20you%20take%20a%20peek%20at%20this%20r
 eal%20quick!\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/2/loco-bloco-pr
 esents-dia-de-los-muertos-2026-esto-no-se-vende-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7526148;-122.4078356
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34804701/2fd57098-f8d3-4d7e-8aa2-fb796393bd84.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Brava Theater\, 2781 24th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/2/loco-bloco-presents-dia-de-los-m
 uertos-2026-esto-no-se-vende-tickets
