DESCRIPTION:This is Your City. This is Your Voice. This is Your Future. Sh
 are your story about growing up and raising your family in San Francisco.\
 n\nEvery family has a story. Every voice matters. Please share yours.\n\nJ
 oin us for the District 2 Marina Family Summit! The This Is Your City: Fam
 ily Summit Series invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and commu
 nity members from across San Francisco to help shape the future of our cit
 y.\n\nSaturday\, Nov. 7\, 2026\, 11:00 a.m. - 1:30 p.m.\n\nMarina Middle S
 chool\, 3500 Fillmore St\, SF\, CA 94123\n\nFree food\, childcare\, and in
 terpretation are provided. Please note all interpretation requests must be
  made 48 hours or more prior to the Family Summit.\n\nWho should attend? E
 veryone is welcome. This event highlights District 2\, but you can attend 
 any Family Summit that fits your schedule.\n\nWhy are we gathering? The Fa
 mily Summit Series is part of San Francisco's first Citywide Community Nee
 ds Assessment. Through conversations with families across the city\, we're
  learning what matters most to children\, youth\, young adults\, and famil
 ies. What we learn will help improve future planning\, programs\, and serv
 ices.\n\nWhether you've lived in San Francisco your whole life or recently
  made it your home\, your experiences and ideas matter.\n\nDistrict 2 Neig
 hborhoods include: Marina\, Cow Hollow\, Pacific Heights\, Presidio Height
 s\, Jordan Park\, Laurel Heights\, Presidio\, Lower Pacific Heights\, Cath
 edral Hill\, and part of Russian Hill\n\nFree\nSan Francisco Department of
  Children\, Youth & Their Families (DCYF)\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf
 .io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fdistrict-2-marina-fami
 ly-summit-tickets-1996548210443%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://do
 thebay.com/events/2026/11/7/district-2-marina-family-summit-tickets\nSourc
 e: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/district-2-marin
 a-family-summit/
