DESCRIPTION:THE SONG & SPIRIT OF LEONARD COHEN\n\nSwedish American Hall\nS
 aturday\, November 7\n7:30PM\n\nConspiracy of Beards present their new sho
 w “The Song & Spirit of Leonard Cohen”\nalong with special guests\, Da
 niel Kahn and Jake Shulman-Ment.\n\nConspiracy of Beards\, the San Francis
 co based choir of men that sing exclusively the songs of Leonard Cohen\, d
 ebut their new show highlighting the music\, life\, and spirit of the late
  troubadour on the 10th anniversary of his passing\, November 7th\, 2016.D
 etroit-born\, Hamburg-based troubadour and multi-instrumentalist Daniel Ka
 hn and New York master fiddler Jake Shulman-Ment have been playing\, trave
 ling and making music together for nearly twenty years – drawing on klez
 mer\, folk\, punk\, poetry and a tradition that has never stopped evolving
 .\n\n$55\nSF Leonard Cohen Festival Presents\n\nTickets: https://www.sfleo
 nardcohenfest.com/nov-7-song-spirit\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/
 2026/11/7/the-song-spirit-of-leonard-cohen-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
