DESCRIPTION:Think you can tell Fiji from Evian in a blind tasting? Know yo
 ur Topo from your Pellegrino just from looking at the bubbles? Have you ev
 er tried salty sparkling Spanish Vichy Catalan\, or experienced the bizarr
 e Borjomi from the Republic of Georgia?\n\nBottled waters differ dramatica
 lly in texture\, minerality\, carbonation\, and finish. We’ll try lots o
 f waters - some familiar and some super weird- and we’ll learn Why they 
 taste the way they do in this alcohol-free experience.\n\nWe’ll start by
  blind tasting San Francisco tap to see if Hetch Hetchy is as heavenly as 
 we’ve heard about. We’ll continue blind tasting bottled still waters f
 rom neutral to mineral-rich\, then crack open a whole bunch of sparkling s
 oda waters and go through them one-by-one.\n\n$55\n\nTickets: https://clas
 sbento.com/international-bottled-water-tasting-class-san-francisco\nDetail
 s: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/21/international-bottled-water-tast
 ing-class-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
