DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSF History Night | Pacific Hei
 ghts\nSherith Israel circa 1910 via OpenSFHistory\nThe San Francisco Histo
 ry Association hosts monthly talks which explore our city’s enchanting h
 istory in depth.\nEach month\, a local history expert hosts a themed talk 
 usually accompanied by a slide show with light refreshments.\n\nMonthly pr
 esentations cover a dizzyingly diverse variety of SF history aspects\, fro
 m the history of the San Francisco Fire Department to appreciation of our 
 unique Victorian houses to vintage stories and photos from Playland-at-the
 -Beach.\nSan Francisco History Association Meeting\nThe last Tuesday of ev
 ery month (except December)\n– Doors open at 7 pm\; program begins about
  7:45 pm\n– Newman Hall\, Congregation Sherith Israel\, 2266 California 
 (at Webster)\, SF 94115.\n– $10 General Public\; FREE if you’re an SFH
 A Member\n\nUpcoming SF History Night | Pacific Heights Events\nTue 10/27 
 SF History Night | Pacific HeightsTue 11/24 SF History Night | Pacific Hei
 ghtsTue 12/29 SF History Night | Pacific HeightsDisclaimer: Please double 
 check event information with the event organizer as events can be canceled
 \, details can change after they are added to our calendar\, and errors do
  occur.\n\n$10.00\n\nTickets: http://sanfranciscohistory.org/meetings/\nDe
 tails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sf-history-night-pacific-heights-100/\nSour
 ce: Funcheap SF
