UID:funcheap-1638191@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSFPLWe’ll be pausing Laughto
 n’s Southern Gothic thriller\, Night of the Hunter\, to draw striking fr
 ames. We’ll be focusing on the art deco design\, dramatic shadows and po
 ses in the film.\nBasic materials (pencils\, paper\, erasers) will be prov
 ided. You may bring your own materials\, but please no fume-creating paint
  or paint pens. Watercolor\, ink and gouache are fine.\n\nThis is a self-l
 ed event\; there will be no instruction or feedback. However\, there will 
 be an opportunity at the end of the session to look at others’ drawings 
 and show your own.\nPG\, 92 mins.\, 1955. Closed captions (CC) in English.
  Due to pauses for drawing\, the full film will not be shown.\nThe event t
 akes places in the Main Library at 100 Larkin Street\, in the Latino/Hispa
 nic Meeting Room.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://sfpl.org/events/2026/12/05/a
 ctivity-drawing-film-night-hunter\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/drawin
 g-filmnight-hunter/\nSource: Funcheap SF
